{"Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/046.bmd|0x007471": "「ラーダさん、今の内に離脱を！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/046.bmd|0x0074A2": "「ラウル、無茶をしちゃ駄目だ！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/046.bmd|0x0074D3": "「ラウル、無理しちゃいけない！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/046.bmd|0x007504": "「アラド、周りをよく見るんだ！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/046.bmd|0x007535": "「少佐、後退して下さい！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/046.bmd|0x00755D": "「少尉、すぐに離脱を！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/046.bmd|0x007582": "「大尉、離脱して下さい！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/046.bmd|0x0075AA": "「コウタ、早く下がって！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/046.bmd|0x0075D2": "「離脱するんだ、フィオナ！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/046.bmd|0x0075FD": "「ジョッシュ、離脱して！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/046.bmd|0x007625": "「リム、危ない！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/046.bmd|0x007641": "「ヒューゴ少尉、後退して下さい！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/046.bmd|0x007675": "「アクア少尉、離脱を！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/046.bmd|0x00769A": "「イング、下がって！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/046.bmd|0x0076BC": "「逃げるんだ、イング！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/046.bmd|0x0076E1": "「下がるんだ、アリエイル！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/046.bmd|0x00770C": "「悪いけど、一気にいくよ！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/046.bmd|0x007737": "「フォーメーションの組み方が甘いんだ！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/046.bmd|0x007774": "「逃げる隙は与えない！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/046.bmd|0x007799": "「まだ攻撃できる！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/046.bmd|0x0077B8": "「もう一撃、受けてもらうよ！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/046.bmd|0x0077E6": "「このチャンス、逃がさない！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/046.bmd|0x007814": "「スプリットミサイル、発射！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/046.bmd|0x007842": "「当ててみせるっ！！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/046.bmd|0x007864": "「これで決める！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/046.bmd|0x007880": "「ターゲット・ロック！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/046.bmd|0x0078A5": "「行け！　ハイ・ツインランチャー！！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/046.bmd|0x0078DF": "「直撃させるっ！！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/046.bmd|0x0078FE": "「これで決めるっ！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/046.bmd|0x00791D": "「行けぇぇっ！！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/046.bmd|0x007939": "「スプリット・ビーム、発射！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/046.bmd|0